WEBVTT

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:06.790
On that day, like what all passionate soccer players yearn for,

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:11.020
we stood on the pitch of FC Barcelona's Camp Nou.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:19.670
There, by playing our own unique brand of soccer,

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.470
we shocked the whole world!

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:00.400
This must be a fated meeting!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.670
We met Masaru-ojisan,

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:05.900
I mean someone amazing like 
Hanashima-san at such a time.

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:07.110
Yeah.

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.810
We must make him our coach!

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:14.110
The Furuyas have also promised that
 they'll come back if he becomes our coach!

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.480
Yeah.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:17.680
Erika-chan!

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:18.950
W-What?

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:21.120
Show some more enthusiasm!{Get a bit more hyped! }

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.820
This is about our team!

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:26.590
You're always way too early in the morning!{You're always so pumped up so early in the morning. }

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:29.090
Can't this coach stuff wait until after school?

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:33.670
I'll show him how serious I am by 
visiting him first thing in the morning!

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.500
You're killing me here.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:44.010
Why am I in my room?

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:56.790
Oh yeah.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.370
Why am I thinking about that now?

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:17.680
Good morning!

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.680
Is anyone home!?

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.680
You're so loud, jeez!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.980
You're disturbing the neighbors!{You'll disturb the neighbors! }

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:27.050
Good morning!

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:30.060
Um, I'm here to ask you again!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.960
Please become our coach!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.260
You're really amazing, Hanashima-san!

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:38.330
I was really moved by that shot yesterday!{That shot yesterday touched me! }

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.400
Please!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:42.300
Yeah! That kick gave me goosebumps!

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:44.200
Me, too! Please be our coach!

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.810
What are you talking about?

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:50.480
Was I drunk? I don't really remember.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:52.780
What are you saying!?

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:55.510
Anyway, I refuse your offer.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:56.920
Please go home.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:03.760
What's with him?

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:07.930
A cute grade schooler like me took her time to visit him!

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.530
"Go home?" Unbelievable!

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:15.330
Then maybe he'll accept the job if you give him a kiss.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.270
Good idea!

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.510
Yeah, right! Idiot!

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.880
What are you doing? I'm being serious here!

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.440
You idiot!

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.380
You're so annoying!

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:30.650
My answer won't cha-

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:33.390
Here, time for breakfast.{Here, some breakfast. }

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:34.950
Kyouko.

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:41.830
Why don't you listen to them?

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.800
Those kids came by, right?

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.400
So what?

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:51.970
Yesterday was the first time I saw you play soccer!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.970
You saw me on video, right?

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.480
Seeing it live is different!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.580
I started going out with you after you retired, after all.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.680
I was just playing around with the kids.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:05.220
You actually want to play soccer, right?

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.190
Not really.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:14.960
Is that so? From time to time, I do see you taking out
 those soccer cleats from that cardboard box and grinning.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:23.800
Masaru-chan?

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.770
I'm going out for some post-meal exercise.

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:36.350
What can we do to make him become our coach?

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:39.890
It'll be tough, seeing how stubborn he is.

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:42.090
Didn't that lady say so, too?

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:45.360
"I don't think he'll accept your offer."

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.330
Oh yeah!

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:50.530
If you lose to me in a heading contest, you'll become our coach!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.200
How's that?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.330
You idiot.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:55.270
I knew it.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:58.600
Then I'll give him free yakiniku coupons to my family's restaurant!

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:00.640
Ah, that might work!

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.510
You carry those with you!?

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:04.480
Good morning.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:06.310
Good morning, Reika-chan.

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:07.480
Good morning.

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:09.110
What were you talking about?

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:12.250
We're trying to lure this guy into becoming our coach.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:13.320
Coach?

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:15.320
How about this?

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:20.990
We take some embarrassing pictures of him and blackmail him!

00:06:20.990 --> 00:06:22.790
That's it!

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:24.460
Let me write that down. Wait up.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:25.400
Don't write that down!

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.700
I was just following along with your stupidity!

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.970
Then these free yakiniku coupons are the answer!

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:32.170
Enough of that!

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.430
Are you going to his apartment?

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.230
Yep, that's right.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.540
Yo.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.840
I investigated him a little.{I've looked up on him. }

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:44.380
Here.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.140
Hanashima Masaru.

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:49.310
He was a player on the J League's Chiba Thunderbolts.

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:55.190
When the Thunderbolts were in J2, he was a forward who led the league in goals scored and scoring ratio.

00:07:55.190 --> 00:08:00.860
With his powerful right-footed shot, 
he was known as the Lightning Light.

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:06.370
The year the Thunderbolts were promoted to J1, he hurt his lower back and was forced to retire.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:10.570
He was unable to show off his skills in J1.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:12.140
He was a professional player!

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:14.070
He's amazing!

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:17.110
That's not all.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:23.520
He became the coach for Chiba's elementary 
school team, Miyakogawa FC, after he retired.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.820
He led them to a top 8 finish in the 
Japanese Boys National Soccer Tournament.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.390
But for some reason, he left the team after the tournament.

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:32.490
Right now he's unemployed.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:36.130
He has proven that he is a good coach.

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:41.200
So it's time for us to get serious.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.800
There's someone who just can't wait.

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:46.710
Okay! Let's all go ask him!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:47.740
Wait a second.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:52.810
There's a more effective way than just asking him.

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:56.550
You want me to join your team in another mini game?

00:08:56.550 --> 00:08:57.520
Yes.

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:01.690
If we win, the Furuyas promised to come back to our team.

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:04.960
Forget about the coach stuff for now. Please!

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:08.530
You're the only one who can help us beat the triplets!

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:10.500
Give me a break.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.560
Why would I-

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.230
Hilarious.

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:17.500
This old man can beat us?

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:23.180
Does he think he can pull off a lucky shot again like the one he did yesterday?

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.380
Impossible.

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:25.980
Right, Kota?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.150
Oh?

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:32.350
Will he really fall for such simple taunts?

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:38.220
Interesting.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.630
Let me show you that it was not a fluke.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:41.860
He fell for it!

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:04.420
You're letting us attack first?

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:21.730
Kota-kun!

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:37.220
1-0 already.

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:39.250
Yeah.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:04.440
As expected, feints aren't working at all. If that's the case...

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:23.660
It's here.

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:27.670
We'll show him all of our good points.

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:34.410
When you guys have the ball, 
try to show off your good points, too.

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:52.620
Nice header!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:55.690
Oh? He's gotten much better.

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:59.100
Yes!

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:02.100
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.420
Run!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.350
Good!

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:19.180
Pass it here!

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:20.220
Erika-chan!

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.820
I'm getting pumped up.

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:24.390
The triplets each have their own tricks.

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.420
Erika has a lot of speed.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:29.230
Shou's skills aren't very good, 
but he always keeps his eyes on the ball.

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:32.430
These kids play some very interesting soccer.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.900
But...

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.190
It's an out-of-the-park home run.

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.660
Oh crap.

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:03.630
Jeez, it flew this far.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:08.900
We found the ball, but let's end the game here.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.840
That's no good, Hanashima-san.

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:12.540
Yeah.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.840
Why did you dodge that last shot?

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:17.480
I didn't want to get hurt.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.910
I saw how powerful that shot was yesterday.

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:24.420
Well, even though we lost 2-1, there's nothing we can do.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:26.820
In order for us to return to the Momoyama Predators,

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:30.320
we need an excellent coach.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:33.860
Was this what you guys were aiming for?

00:13:33.860 --> 00:13:35.290
Coach Hanashima!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:38.900
Please become our coach! Please!

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:45.670
I won't become your coach.

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:48.840
I don't have the right to.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.580
Youhei!

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.280
H-Hang in there, Youhei!

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:58.220
Youhei!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.620
He was the best player and ace of the team.

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:03.490
All of our tactics revolved around him.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:08.990
I was so stupid that I didn't realize
 how much of a burden I placed on him.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:12.630
I robbed him of his vision and his future.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:18.070
I won't coach soccer ever again.

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.710
No matter what?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:21.840
Yeah.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.580
But you love soccer, right?

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:31.550
I understood just by playing with you.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.790
You still love soccer!

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.720
Then come join us...

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.160
Sorry.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:45.230
I see.

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:46.460
Yes.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.830
Looks like this might be impossible.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.640
Don't say that!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.770
We just have to ask him again and again! I'm sure...

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:54.640
But!

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:57.410
I want him to be our coach, too.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.080
But after hearing all that...

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:11.220
Oh?

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:16.430
Are you here to ask him about coaching?

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.130
Coach! Coach?

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:19.900
Where is our coach!?

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:26.070
I understand your passion, but he's quite stubborn.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.570
I won't give up!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:31.310
I'll come here again and again until he agrees!

00:15:31.310 --> 00:15:34.780
Hanashima-san still loves soccer!

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:38.420
I love soccer too, so I'm sure we can connect with each other! {Comma after "soccer" not needed, so removed it.}

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:41.890
I see...

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:44.360
Yes! That's good!

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:45.920
You're quite good!

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.760
Okay, I'll help you out!

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.000
You will?

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.860
Call me Kyouko!

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:55.730
Here's my secret weapon!

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:59.140
A smartphone?

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.680
Hanashima-san!

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:08.250
Wha-? Y-You?

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.680
Please become our coach!

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:12.580
I already refused!

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:14.190
Please become our coach!

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:16.420
No is no!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.930
Kyouko-san, he ran away.

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:24.600
Oh? How sneaky.

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:33.810
Pwease bwecome ouwr coaf! {Butchered due to odd kinda speaking :3}

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.710
Him again?

00:16:35.710 --> 00:16:37.680
What's going on!?

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:40.550
Oh-ho-ho! You're not getting away!

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.780
Please!

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:51.560
Hanashima-san, how about becoming our coach?

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:55.290
He didn't wash his hands...

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:02.430
Coach!

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.640
No good? That's too bad.

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:12.780
Time for our next plan!

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:17.080
Why do you want to eat yakiniku all of a sudden?

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:20.590
I got these coupons for this very popular place!

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:23.860
Welcome!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:26.820
This is your place, eh!?{So you live here!? }

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:31.300
Yes! Our meat is very delicious! We'll give you great service!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:32.860
I'm going home.

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.400
W-Wait!

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.440
Wait!

00:17:39.340 --> 00:17:40.610
No good?

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:43.110
Hey! Hey, come on!

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:46.510
Did you tell him where I was this entire time?

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:51.120
Well, I wanted to test out this app on my smartphone...

00:17:51.120 --> 00:17:54.490
You know why I refused the coaching job!

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:57.160
I don't want anyone else to get hurt 
because of unforgiving expectations!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:00.990
S-Sorry.

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:04.530
But is this really okay?

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:06.360
You're just gonna give up on soccer like this?

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.800
You still love soccer, right?

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:15.940
Masaru-chan...

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.090
You're pretty good at soccer, Reika-chan!

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:31.220
Really?

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.590
Yep! You have good soccer sense.

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:37.900
Sorry to drag you out here on a Sunday. Shou-kun's not at home, it seems.

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:40.230
It's okay. This is quite fun.

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:42.630
How long are you going to follow me around for?

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:44.770
Until you agree on becoming our coach!

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:44.770
Shou-kun?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:47.410
You're annoying! Go home!

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:49.470
I won't!

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:52.740
Oh goodness. He hasn't given up yet?

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:56.150
But he's doing his best.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:19:00.750
Yeah. As his teammate, I can't just ignore him.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:02.420
Sorry, Reika-chan.

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:04.190
It's okay. Do your best!

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:06.090
Come with me, Zach!

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:27.280
Kota, how about a match?

00:19:27.280 --> 00:19:28.450
Sure.

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:32.720
I think you should forget about him becoming our coach.

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:33.620
That's right.

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:35.620
Time for the comeback goal!

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:37.620
What's with you, all of a sudden!?

00:19:37.620 --> 00:19:40.120
Look over there! Over there!

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.360
Please become our coach!

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.160
No!

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.360
Please become our coach!

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:44.100
I refuse!

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:46.330
We need help for the comeback!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.600
Help?

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.700
Aren't you just chasing him around?

00:19:52.740 --> 00:19:54.910
There's no helping it, then.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:03.650
Why are there more of you!?

00:20:05.920 --> 00:20:08.990
I won't let you get away! I'm the Speed Star!

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:10.760
Let's pincer him!

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:12.720
Okay!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.490
Wait up!

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.670
Damn it!

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:22.970
He's getting away!

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:24.040
Over there, Kota!

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.340
Please become our coach!

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:26.340
I refuse!

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:27.410
You're going to fall!

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.610
How stubborn!

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:45.560
Jeez, how long are you going to chase me for?

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:48.760
Until you become our coach.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:53.000
Normally people would give up already.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.570
It's something you taught me, Coach Hanashima. {not to give up}

00:20:56.570 --> 00:21:01.870
I was so bad at heading, but I got a lot better with practice.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:04.940
I can't give up.

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:12.450
Are you really fine with me becoming your coach?

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:14.290
Yes!

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.590
It must be you and no one else!

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:17.890
Please!

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:21.890
We want to be the best in the entire country.

00:21:21.890 --> 00:21:23.590
Please help us out.

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:25.300
Please!

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:28.770
Please, Coach Hanashima!

00:21:30.570 --> 00:21:31.740
That's no good.

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:37.410
Best in the country? That goal's too tiny!

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:39.940
If you're serious, aim higher!

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:42.050
S-So that means...

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.980
You'll become our coach?

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:47.250
It can't be helped.

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:50.120
Yes!

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.290
Listen up.

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:56.260
Our mini game and what La Liga players play are both soccer.

00:21:56.260 --> 00:22:02.700
If we can do what Beckham and Zidane 
have done, then we must aim even higher!

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:05.470
We must become number one in the entire world!

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:15.550
That's it.

00:22:15.550 --> 00:22:17.980
What do we do, Captain?

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.750
Captain?

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:21.720
Eh!? I'm the captain!?

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:24.860
You were the one who brought us all together, right?

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:26.790
The captain has to be you.

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:27.930
That's right.

00:22:27.930 --> 00:22:28.930
Yep.

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:33.400
Let's go, Captain. It's decided.

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:37.900
Then let's aim to become world number one... no...

00:22:43.440 --> 00:22:46.040
The number one team in the entire galaxy!

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:47.710
Number one in the entire galaxy, huh?

00:22:47.710 --> 00:22:50.650
That sounds like a worthy goal.

00:22:50.650 --> 00:22:54.920
In any case, Shou-kun's the one whose soccer needs the most work.

00:24:35.020 --> 00:24:37.090
We're aiming to become number one in the galaxy!

00:24:37.090 --> 00:24:39.260
The Momoyama Predators are finally back!

00:24:39.260 --> 00:24:40.220
Not yet!

00:24:40.220 --> 00:24:43.230
Unless we get 11 total members, we can't enter the tournaments!

00:24:43.230 --> 00:24:45.230
We somehow have 10...

00:24:45.230 --> 00:24:46.200
We need one more.

00:24:46.200 --> 00:24:47.800
That's the problem.

00:24:47.800 --> 00:24:48.630
Oh!

00:24:49.370 --> 00:24:50.970
Don't tell me, that person is...

00:24:50.970 --> 00:24:55.010
Next time on Ginga e Kickoff! The 11th Player.
